  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 502.02 Copy of Label at Site. A complete copy of pesticide labeling, as it appears on the original registered product, shall accompany all service containers and pesticide application equipment in the vehicle transporting them.\n\nSource. #1547, eff 3-13-80; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96, EXPIRED: 5-30-04\n\nNew. #8131, eff 8-13-04; ss by #10333, eff 5-10-13; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
